      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello, Father.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ": 你好，神父。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. What-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 嘿。什么——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm already on my way.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ": 我已经在路上了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Why? What if I wasn't calling to invite you over?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 什么？为什么？万一我打来不是为了叫你过来呢？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you wouldn't be calling at all.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ": 那你就根本不会打。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's...fair, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 这……倒是说得通，我猜。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shall I bring a {i}whip?{/i} Or will just my body suffice?",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ": 要我带条{i}鞭子{/i}来吗？还是说只带我的身体就够了？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just your body is fine. I'll see you soon, Nodoka.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 身体就够了。回头见，Nodoka。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, you certainly will.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ": 哦，你一定会见到我的。"
    },
